<p> *  2 Dec 96 - Petru Lucinschi won the run-off vote against  *</p>
<p> *		 Mircea Snegur, 54 percent to 46, in the	 *</p>
<p> *		 presidencial race.				    *</p>
<p> *************************************************************</p>
